# The gate code beyond the lint plugin's defaults, which no gate runs while it differs from HEAD:
# the pins of the Python tools and collections, the settings of ansible and ansible-lint, the
# inventory, and any Python, bytecode or extension module. ansible-lint loads them, and
# python3 -m venv imports them from the tree's root.
.github/lint-requirements.in
.github/lint-requirements.txt
requirements.yml
ansible.cfg
.ansible-lint*
.config
inventory.ini
*.py
*.pyc
*.so
